/T ( Zhixiaobao surfaces AI capabilities through a conversation-based assistant embedded inside Alipay. Users express their intent in natural language, and the system responds with actionable cards, buttons, and shortcuts instead of long text answers.  Each card links directly to an existing Alipay service \(such as payments, transport, or food delivery\), turning the assistant into a service navigation and execution layer rather than a standalone chatbot.)
